{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa in San Francisco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What Will You Do, Peter?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Modals for Possibility", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to show possibility. They have the same meaning.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They are placed before a verb in the base form. The verb does not change.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I have an idea about a future work possibility I may explore. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I might go into a career in advertising or communications. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That may be the case.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It could be true.  ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "marketing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the activities involved in selling a product or service, including advertising, shipping, storing, and selling", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Right now I'm working in marketing. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear to talk about work possibilities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "advertising ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the promotion of a product or service by communicating information by radio, television, Internet, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I might go into a career in advertising or communications.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "print ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in writing, like a newspaper or magazine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In the future, online advertising will be more direct than print or television advertising. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lifestyle ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the choices you make; the way you live your life ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The ads people see online will be based on their own lifestyle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "travel agency ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an office where people sell travel packages ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If people like travel, they will come across ads from travel agencies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "renovations ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "improving a building by making major changes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: If people like to do home renovations, the ads will be about construction materials.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "career field ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of jobs or professions that are related ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have an idea about a career field I may explore.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a career field you know something about.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, discuss how things will be different in the future.", 